# #128  Registry lookups are slow on cold start

https://gitlab.example.com/acme/platform/-/issues/128

status: To do
labels: prio::high, type::bug
assignees: you
sprint: 2026-08-24 - 2026-09-06
updated: 2026-08-24

## Description

Cold start walks the whole registry before the first request is served.

The lookup is O(n) over every entry and the cache is only populated on the second
request, so the first one after a deploy pays for all of them.

- [ ] index the registry by name at load
- [ ] warm the cache on boot

## Comments  2

